## Snapshot.cpp/Snapshot::save, a picture it cannot save
0 by 0, 2 read back -> frame 0: shoots 1; logged []; files none; frame 1: shoots 0; logged ["error: <here>/f.png not saved: a picture of 0 by 0 pixels, and it reads 2 at most"]; files none
2 by 1, 0 read back -> frame 0: shoots 1; logged []; files none; frame 1: shoots 0; logged ["error: <here>/f.png not saved: a picture of 2 by 1 pixels, and it reads 0 at most"]; files none
3 by 1, 2 read back -> frame 0: shoots 1; logged []; files none; frame 1: shoots 0; logged ["error: <here>/f.png not saved: a picture of 3 by 1 pixels, and it reads 2 at most"]; files none

